{"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Preferences","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit’s preference system enables ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"bottom-up data flow","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the reverse of environment values. While the environment passes data down from parent to child, preferences let child views publish values that ancestors can observe and react to.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system mirrors SwiftUI’s preference API and consists of three parts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Protocol that defines a named value type with a default and a reduce strategy","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Type-safe storage that holds all preference values for a scope"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"PreferenceStorage","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Stack-based collector that manages preference contexts per render pass","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A built-in example is "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a child view sets "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationTitle(\"Settings\")"},{"type":"text","text":", and the enclosing navigation container reads that preference to render the title bar."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Defining-a-Preference-Key","level":2,"text":"Defining a Preference Key","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A preference key declares what type of value it carries and how multiple values from sibling children are combined:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct CounterKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: Int = 0","","    static func reduce(value: inout Int, nextValue: () -> Int) {","        value += nextValue()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"defaultValue","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":": Returned when no child has set this preference","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"reduce(value:nextValue:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":": Combines values when multiple children set the same key","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default "},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation simply takes the last value. Override it when you need additive behavior (summing counts), array collection, or other merge strategies."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Setting-a-Preference","level":2,"text":"Setting a Preference","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Child views publish a preference using the ","type":"text"},{"code":".preference(key:value:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Item\")","            .preference(key: CounterKey.self, value: 1)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under the hood, this wraps the view in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" that calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferences.setValue(_:forKey:)"},{"type":"text","text":" during rendering. The value is reduced into the current scope using the key’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reduce"},{"type":"text","text":" function."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Observing Preferences","type":"heading","anchor":"Observing-Preferences"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ancestor views react to collected preferences using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onPreferenceChange(_:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemList: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","        }","        .onPreferenceChange(CounterKey.self) { totalCount in","            \/\/ totalCount == 3 (three children each set value: 1, additive reduce)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier pushes a new preference context, renders all children (which set their preferences), pops the context, and fires the callback with the accumulated result."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"The Navigation Title Shortcut","type":"heading","anchor":"The-Navigation-Title-Shortcut"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit provides ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","type":"reference"},{"text":" as a built-in preference key with a convenience modifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct SettingsPage: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(\"App settings go here\")","        }","        .navigationTitle(\"Settings\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"NavigationTitleKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" uses the default ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (last value wins), so the deepest child’s title takes precedence.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How Preferences Flow per Frame","type":"heading","anchor":"How-Preferences-Flow-per-Frame","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Preferences are collected fresh every frame. Here’s the lifecycle within a single render pass:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reset"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"RenderLoop.render()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"preferences.beginRenderPass()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", clearing all callbacks and resetting the stack to a single empty context","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": As the view tree renders top-down, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" views call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setValue(_:forKey:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which reduces values into the current stack frame"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope"}]},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OnPreferenceChangeModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" pushes a new context before rendering its subtree, isolating child preferences"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Collect","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": After the subtree finishes, the modifier pops the context (merging into the parent) and fires the callback with the scoped result","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discard"}]},{"type":"text","text":": At the start of the next frame, everything resets: stale preferences never persist"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This per-frame reset ensures preferences always reflect the current view tree. Removed views stop contributing automatically."}]},{"text":"Reduce Strategies","type":"heading","anchor":"Reduce-Strategies","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" function determines how multiple children’s values combine. Common patterns:"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strategy"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Implementation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use Case"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Last value wins"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value = nextValue()"},{"type":"text","text":" (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Titles, labels: deepest child wins","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Additive","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value += nextValue()"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Counting items, summing heights"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Array collection","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathering menu items, breadcrumbs"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Array collection example","struct BreadcrumbKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: [String] = []","","    static func reduce(value: inout [String], nextValue: () -> [String]) {","        value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/preferences"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"],"anchor":"Guides"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Pass data from child views up to their ancestors.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Protocols","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey"],"anchor":"Protocols"},{"title":"Storage","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"],"anchor":"Storage"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/AppearanceAndColors":{"role":"article","title":"Appearance and Colors","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/appearanceandcolors","kind":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","abstract":[{"text":"Control border styles, visual appearances, and the color system.","type":"text"}]},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/NavigationTitleKey":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","title":"NavigationTitleKey","abstract":[{"text":"A preference key for the navigation title.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/navigationtitlekey","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Navigatio